{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 14, :comments ["<b>And he said</b> — Every instance of קנאה linked with lamed is unlike one linked with bet. Here it is like \"Are you jealous for me?\" — the meaning is \"on account of,\" like \"YHWH was jealous for His land\" — on account of His land. And it is jealousy for the good of the one mentioned. But when it is linked with bet, like \"the Philistines were jealous of him,\" it is the opposite."], :book :zechariah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 1, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Zecharia -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/zecharya"] ["1" "http://www.daat.ac.il/daat/olam_hatanah/mefaresh.asp?book=25&perek=5&mefaresh=ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:45:37.169026493Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}